; GAME ENTITIES
; File: entities.asm
; Description: Game entity definitions and behavior
; ==================================================================
;
; INTELLIGENT FILTERING ACTIVE:
;   Entity templates in project: 15
;   Actually instantiated: 1
;   Filtered out: 14 unused templates
